# reduced-q (plan section 6, M10): motion-q under reduced motion (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce;
# macOS's Reduce motion natively): Q only fades, 120 ms each way, its drop lines whole from the
# start; Q's row fades in over 120 ms linearly both ways (PointRows.module.css). The same frames as
# motion-q.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
move 881 376
frames q-in every 16 for 176
wait 300
move 760 48
frames q-out every 16 for 144
